    - '// @input string skipGroupIds {"hint":"Comma-separated list of <g> id values whose entire subtree should be skipped. Useful for 3D-exported SVGs that include interior fold lines (e.g. \"MeshIntersection,Crease,Material,Pupils,Boundary\"). Match is exact and case-sensitive."}'
